range before it gives up, so \code{fdDPO}, \code{fpDPO} and \code{fqDPO} each
take about 50 s (49.5 to 49.8 s measured) to answer \code{NaN} (\code{NA}
for \code{fqDPO}). An infinite \code{mu} or \code{sigma} gives \code{NaN}
at once.
